tmp_text "Who deleted ALL the notes ??????Someone please leave some good tips forour new -sans  :-)Thanks!Jewel**Butt-Head: Hey Beavis, what do you think of the Ninja Guild?Beavis: They kick ASS!Butt-Head: Hu Uh UH UH HU You said Ass!Beavis: UH HU HU UH UH UH UH! Yeah Yeah...That was Cool.Butt-Head: Shut-Up! Beavis!  Don't make me smack you!Beavis: Go ahead and try Ass Munch.  I'm Guru and your not!Butt-Head: HU HU UH UH HU HU HU You said Guru!Beavis: Yeah Yeah HU UH UH HU HU!Butt-Head: Yes! This is the Ninja-San Room.  These Ninjas are the Kings ofthe Guilds!  Their are none Higher!Beavis: Yes! (Starts Head-Banging!)Beavis & Butt-Head: (Start into the Paradise City Theme!)Butt-Head: I'm glad I'm in the Ninja Guild.  I can kick Ass!Beavis: Yeah, Yeah! Me too.  This is a manly Guild!Butt-Head: Manly yes!  But Beavis likes it too! HU UH HU HU UH!Beavis:  Shut-Up Butt-Munch!  HU HU HU UH UH UH UH UHHU !!!**Welcome to the 127th National Guild Blood Bowl!!! This should be a excitinggame, ladies and gentleman.And theres the kick off....OUCH..There goes a Mages head, man those thingsfly far!  And Here comes the Thief's, what only one Thief?  Damn!  Taken outcold...OUCH!  Barbarians and VagaBonds taking each other out and the Ninjas'are cleaning the place up.  There goes the Ninja Wizards! \"Yeah Yeah\" and herecomes a few players....Gambit...The Quarterback, energizing ever ball thatleaves his hands!!  Axl Rose...Best damn defense man we got, killing and cleaning everything out of the way.  Rest of the Team...Sushi, Labarum, Ren,and many many others...Wait here comes the water boys....Gollum and Wilbiewith head water man Tatsuo...And that wraps up the season of Guilds with Ninjas again being on top!!!!!!This is your T.V. Announcer Gumbo leaving you with this...\"If you cant win,cheat!!\"**Yes every good TV show has it's own theme song and we can all sing a few of them... but this mud doesn't have them ... at least until now.First off let us put our ever present hordes of Mages with the classic tune:\"HOLD on for the night\"Next has to come the Thief (note singular) and the 80's tune:\"Only the Lonely can Play\"Now comes those ever present and \"loveable\" jediany suggestion for the rest post them**Butt-Head: Hey Beavis, since we are great Ninjas, what should we do now?Beavis: Lets go burn stuff!Beavis: FIRE! FIRE! HU HU HU UH UH UH UH HU!Butt-Head: Calm down Beavis, dont hose your Ninja suit!Beavis: Uh Yeah! HU HU UH UH!Newbie: Hello, can I become a Ninja?(Look at each other!)Butt-Head: Sure, we just have to get some almonds for you!Beavis: Yeah!  Just have to get some nuts for you!Butt-Head: HU HU UH UH HU You said Nuts HU HU UH!Beavis: YEA! YEA! HU HU UH UH UH HU!Butt-Head: Hey Beavis, check out my Guru in Throwing!Beavis: Only thing your Guru in is spanking your monkey!Butt-Head: Dont make me Karate you Beavis!Butt-Head: (Bounces Shuriken off of desk and pokes into Beavis eye!)Beavis: AAARRRGGHHHHH (Pulls out Shuriken!)Butt-Head: Cool, it works...Insane Damage! HU HU UH UH UH HU!Beavis: YEA! YEA! HU HU UH UH HU HU HU!**Great moments in ninja history:Assassin reaches the level entitled \"assassin\", pre-outcast days.His title on the guildline: Assassin Assassin. Meaning he's got four asses.(And now for something completely different: A man with three buttocks)(Actually this is just the result of a sugar high revisited. I overdosedon m&m's and Easter candy last night... and yes, this is my first time inthe guild room.) =)**Hello, and welcome back to the top news story of the evening.  Our top storyis of a top news story becoming a top news story that wasnt a top news storybefore it became a top news story.  Wait a second...(Throws sheet out the window)  Ok here we go...The top news story for tonight is the exclusice deathof a man a paper cut that just happen moments ago when someone throw a paperout of a window and it sliced the man throat.  We have top information on thepaper and the paper reads...Tonight top news story is about how a news storybecomes a top news story....Wait a second?This is crazy and I'm out of here....This whole script is screwy....Stupidist thing I have every read...Well, what do you expect out a the ninja guild?(Leaves)(Little old man with a long beard comes on....)IT'S!**Okay kiddies. Story time. (don't you dare call me Grandma Sushi ...theLoremaster is tellin this story so siddown and shaddup or you'reall going to be turned into SHEEP... and you know how Silasloooooooves sheep.... *smirk*So.... once there was this chick from a small college - an art student -and she's just come back in from her usual haunts, exhausted from toomuch homework, too much computers,and no sex for some reason...She's doing her FRENCH homework and the girl from down the hall, knownas J, stops in, asking if she has scissors to trim a rose stem for her.Now.... J has a notorius rep for being inconsiderate....In fact, on their first meeting, J invites the art chick into her room with Sta, another hallmate.The art student has a very chilled can of soda from her window ledge sinceshe's too poor to afford an icebox. J spies yonder soda, asks if she mayopen said can, and the art student is kind enough to share. Said artstudent gets that can back HALF GONE. She wipes the can off, takes a few sips...J asks for more. The art student just did not learn her lesson the firsttime, gives J the can, and gets it back EMPTY. After a while, the trioorders Chinese food from a place that delivers (J leeches money off ofSta) and followingthis, J and Sta light up for a smoke when Sta knows fullwell that this art student does NOT smoke and does not like it when peoplesmoke near her. The art student gets up, makes an excuse to do laundry, andexits the room for 20 minutes, returning after the room no longer looks likea cloud landed in theplace.Now J asks, after the rose gets trimmed if she can hang. Hoping J will notbe long, the art student allows her in. Right off, J asks for a drink. Artstudent-chick goes and makes a FULL mug for the pig. J takes a sip of hericed tea, and LEAVES it. Then she asks for \"munchies\", which art-chicksays are in very limited supply (lies, says she does not have any)...By this point, J is scoping out the room.	J starts to open art-chick's art supply box (like a toolbox) and THENasks if it's ok. Art chick says ok, figuring J will be BORED. Instead, J picks up the most expensive items... including tubes of paint, which she_proceeds_to_open_ saying \"I wonder what color this makes\" - Art chick quietlky reprimands J, asking her to leave the paint alone. J then asks ifart chick has any cash to loan her for dinner at the main cafeteria, which thinks cheap food can have high prices... Art-chick says she blew all hercash from that weekend on a trip to a dance club in the city (another wonderful story...*sarcasm*) and J asks \"what about your meal card\"?art-chick refuses, so J goes back to her room, picks up the phone, and says\"Sta? Cash.\" and gets it. Now... J has screwed up art chicks old walkman, &art chick is officially BANISHING J from her room and any other fucking bitch/bastard who tries to sponge off her and go through her shit and break things. To this day, J still lives in the same dorm, and the tensionrises.....      Coming soon to a theater near u.**if you are unable to clean spirit ( and have no hp/sp lines in your score)type fix it's a bug that a few of us have gotten.....BTW sorry about posting a serious note *grin***Why has our guild been depowered? My critical hitting sorta sucks, to behonest, I only do \"pound\" and an occasional \"bloody bodypart\" damage, noinsanes, like the good old days :(  Help me out on this one, I ask, why?  Why, oh, why?  Was it necessary? Or has the hand of fate played a part in this unforunate event?Well, perhaps we will be all wiser when we are 